### E-Commerce Backend API Endpoints Reference

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Admin: Get Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories

### 3. Admin: Get Brands
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/brands

### 4. Auth: Register Buyer
# Note: You can also use multipart/form-data to upload an avatar image (field 'avatar').
# Below is standard JSON registration.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/buyer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Buyer",
  "email": "jane@buyer.com",
  "phone": "+992918111111",
  "password": "buyerpassword"
}

### 5. Auth: Register Seller & Shop
# Note: You can upload an avatar image using field 'avatar' in multipart/form-data.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/seller
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Seller",
  "shopName": "Best Electronics",
  "description": "Premium electronics store in Dushanbe",
  "email": "bob@seller.com",
  "phone": "+992901222222",
  "password": "sellerpassword"
}

### 6. Auth: Login (Works for Buyers, Sellers, Admins)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@seller.com",
  "password": "sellerpassword"
}

### Save login token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 7. Auth: Get Current Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Products: Get All Products (Public)
# Query Parameters: search, categoryId, brandId, color, size, shopId
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=phone

### 9. Products: Get Product Details (Public)
# Replace :id with actual product uuid
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/replace-with-product-uuid

### 10. Shops: Get List of Shops (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops

### 11. Shops: Get Shop Details & Products (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/replace-with-shop-uuid

### 12. Cart: Get Cart (Buyer Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Cart: Add Item to Cart (Buyer Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "replace-with-product-uuid",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 14. Wishlist: Get Wishlist (Buyer Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Wishlist: Add Item to Wishlist (Buyer Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "replace-with-product-uuid"
}

### 16. Chat: Get Conversations list (Buyer/Seller Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Chat: Get Message History (Buyer/Seller Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/history/replace-with-partner-user-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
